{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>\u300a \u00a0 &quot;You neither possess soul nor heart to walk amongst the Home colony with your head held high.</i>&quot;\u00a0 \u300b</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Story:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You have been exiled from society. The Magistrate has sent you to a\u00a0remote outpost far from the Home colony. Your only chance for redemption is to successfully locate a radar signal\u00a0deep in the canyons nearby. Can you find it before you lose all favor in the eyes of the Home colony?</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong><i>Features:</i></strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u2619\u00a0 \u00a0 Experience a strange and mysterious story in this visual novel with light point-and-click elements.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u2619 \u00a0\u00a0 Explore the outpost and get to know your co-workers, Noyes and Twisse.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u2619\u00a0 \u00a0 An original soundtrack full of suspense, thrills, and atmospheric ambience.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >\u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0 \u2619 \u00a0\u00a0 Approximately 30 to 40 minutes playtime with two different not-quite-endings.</p>","achievements":{"highlighted":[{"name":"Feeble and Repugnant","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740390/a202476abba158d3444b416eadba0355c3e46d2a.jpg"},{"name":"What He Deserves","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740390/36818a811c692bad1e894d75ab888d0aa2eec75a.jpg"},{"name":"From Our Magistrate Himself","path":"https://cdn.akamai.steamstatic.com/steamcommunity/public/images/apps/3740390/72190e17ebfb1b63fdca89957cb3c2eb67246329.jpg"}],"total":3},"background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3740390?t=1749827767","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3740390/0cba6797a4a672e84bccbcc783232acd